//   Phase 2a/5a/forced-warmup (ConstrainedStep + AppendConstrainedToken):
//     ConstrainedStep hard-masks to parser-valid tokens plus EOS.
//     AppendConstrainedToken's postcondition gives
//     parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut + [next]).
//     EOS path breaks without appending. ✓
//
//   Phase 2b/5b/forced-inner (CloseSpanIfComplete + ConstrainedStep):
//     CloseSpanIfComplete closed path: insideConstrainedOut := false,
//     implication vacuously true, currentConstrainedOut := []. ✓
//     Not-closed path: ConstrainedStep + AppendConstrainedToken as above. ✓
//
//   Phase 3/5c/6-close/7 (CloseSpanWithinBudget):
//     Library postcondition guarantees
//     insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut). ✓
//
//   Phase 4 (UnconstrainedStep + RenderedEndsWith):
//     insideConstrainedOut stays false until RenderedEndsWith("<<");
//     EnterObservedConstrainedSpan sets currentConstrainedOut := []. ✓
//
//   Phase 6 (OpenConstrainedSpan):
//     Sets currentConstrainedOut := [] which is parser-valid. ✓
//
// Invariant 2 — progress: |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//   Phase 1: UnconstrainedChunk postcondition gives
//     |generatedOut| <= |old generated| + stepsUsed; steps += stepsUsed. ✓
//   Phase 2a/5a/forced-warmup: each iteration ConstrainedStep +1 step,
//     AppendConstrainedToken +1 token (EOS: +1 step, 0 tokens). ✓
//   Phase 2b/5b/forced-inner: CloseSpanIfComplete closed → +1 step, +1 ">>" token.
//     Not-closed → ConstrainedStep +1 step, AppendConstrainedToken +1 token. ✓
//   Phase 3/5c/6-close/7: CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition
//     |generatedOut| <= |generated| + budget; steps += budget. ✓
//   Phase 4: UnconstrainedStep +1 step, generated grows by at most 1. ✓
//   Phase 6 (OpenConstrainedSpan): +1 step, appends "<<" (1 token). ✓
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

generated := generatedPrefix;
